ble` 的二进制 CNI 插件，但调度到的节点上该插件缺失。\n\n这直接导致 kubelet 在初始化 Pod 沙箱时调用 Multus 插件失败，引发 `FailedCreatePodSandBox` 错误，进而使 Pod 陷入 `ContainerCreating` 的等待状态（证据：`fact-b9720a9f6dfa`, `fact-4a6a771ce8a6`）。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.1m\n├─ 问题定位: 21.4s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 34.9s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v14/workload: 34.9s (Evidence 27.1s, RCA 7.6s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 11.7s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v14/workload**: pod-imagepull-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 68.018, "metrics": {"run_id": "3185ab7f6afd4771", "mttr": {"value": "1.1m", "seconds": 68.02350687980652, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-imagepull-failed", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-imagepull-failed"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": 